  "label": "Class-Based Stereotype",
  "description": "A stereotype that associates individuals with specific social classes, often implying that people from lower socioeconomic backgrounds are inherently less capable, less intelligent, or less moral. In this meme, the term 'white trash' is used to target individuals from lower socioeconomic backgrounds, implying that their recycling behavior is somehow 'right' or 'acceptable' only because they are considered 'trash.' This reinforces the idea that their social status is inherently inferior, regardless of their actions.",
